### URL Feature UI Routes Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/ui/url

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/ui/url
@domain = your-domain.com
@alias = your-alias

### 1. Get URLs Page (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?page=0&pageSize=10
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Create Short URL (UI route - no auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "original_url": "https://www.example.com/very-long-url-that-needs-to-be-shortened",
  "domain": "{{domain}}",
  "alias": "{{alias}}",
  "description": "Example URL for testing"
}

###

### 3. Create URL with minimal data (UI route)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "original_url": "https://www.minimal-example.com",
  "domain": "{{domain}}"
}

###

### 4. Create URL with empty domain (uses default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "original_url": "https://www.example.com",
  "domain": ""
}

###

### 5. Update Short URL (UI route - requires session)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{domain}}/{{alias}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "original_url": "https://www.example.com/updated-very-long-url-that-needs-to-be-shortened"
}

###

### 6. Delete Short URL (UI route - requires session)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{domain}}/{{alias}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. Get URLs Page with different pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/?page=1&pageSize=20
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here

###

### 8. Test without session (should fail for protected routes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?page=0&pageSize=10

###

### 9. Test with invalid session
GET {{baseUrl}}/?page=0&pageSize=10
Cookie: session-id=invalid-session-id

###
